WOLF 3D is a first person 3d shooting game using
raycasting technologie to display 3d using 2d engine

USGAGE :
    ./woke3D [map]
In the case before map is a map of 0 and 1s, the map must be a
rectangle and each point represent a part of the map, if the point
is a 1 the point is a wall and if he is 0 there is no wall and 
the player can go threw.

